<title>USA: CHESS-Moves in game six of Kasparov vs. Deep Blue.</title>
<headline>CHESS-Moves in game six of Kasparov vs. Deep Blue.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are the moves in Sunday's sixth and final game of the $1.1 million re-match between world chess champion Garry Kasparov and the IBM supercomputer Deep Blue.</p>
<p>Caro-Kann defence</p>
<p>Deep Blue (white)  Kasparov (black)</p>
<p>    1.  e4		 c6</p>
<p>    2.  d4		 d5</p>
<p>    3.  Nc3		dxe4</p>
<p>    4.  Nxe4	     Nd7</p>
<p>    5.  Ng5		Nf6</p>
<p>    6.  Bd3		e6</p>
<p>    7.  N1f3	     h6</p>
<p>    8.  Nxe6	     Qe7</p>
<p>    9.  O-O		fxe6</p>
<p>    10. Bg6+	     Kd8</p>
<p>    11. Bf4		 b5</p>
<p>    12. a4		  Bb7</p>
<p>    13. Re1		 Nd5</p>
<p>    14. Bg3		 Kc8</p>
<p>    15. axb5		cxb5</p>
<p>    16. Qd3		 Bc6</p>
<p>    17. Bf5		 exf5</p>
<p>    18. Rxe7		Bxe7</p>
<p>    19. c4		  Resigns</p>
<p>1-0 Match score 3-1/2 to 2-1/2</p>
</text>
